<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>TIHA en vivo · San Lucas Innovation Expo 2026</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --navy:#0A1A3D;
    --navy-deep:#071026;
    --gold:#D4AF37;
    --bienestar:#DAA623;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;height:100%;}
  body{
    background:var(--navy);
    color:#fff;
    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    min-height:100vh;
    padding:28px 20px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  body::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    top:-120px; right:-120px;
    width:340px; height:340px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--navy-deep);
    z-index:0;
  }
  body::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    bottom:-140px; left:-140px;
    width:380px; height:380px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--navy-deep);
    z-index:0;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    position:relative; z-index:1;
    font-size:13px;
    letter-spacing:.04em;
    color:var(--gold);
    font-weight:600;
    margin:0 0 8px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  h1{
    position:relative; z-index:1;
    font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
    font-size:clamp(24px,5vw,32px);
    margin:0 0 22px;
    text-align:center;
    max-width:640px;
  }
  .frame{
    position:relative; z-index:1;
    width:100%;
    max-width:900px;
    border-radius:16px;
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(212,175,55,.4), 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
    background:#000;
  }
  .frame iframe{
    width:100%;
    aspect-ratio:16/9;
    border:0;
    display:block;
  }
  .caption{
    position:relative; z-index:1;
    margin-top:18px;
    font-size:14px;
    color:#B9C1D4;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .caption strong{color:var(--gold);}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <p class="eyebrow">San Lucas Innovation Expo 2026</p>
  <h1>Habla con TIHA antes de comenzar</h1>

  <div class="frame">
    <iframe
      src="https://embed.liveavatar.com/v1/69df8b92-66a0-48e9-be43-ab7ef0d78d0e?orientation=horizontal"
      allow="microphone"
      title="LiveAvatar Embed">
    </iframe>
  </div>

  <p class="caption">Modelo TIHA · <strong>Dra. Mariluz Serrano Ortiz, Ed.D.</strong> — cuando termines, cambia a tu presentación.</p>
</body>
</html>
